32c55176 docs(fields): correct the ClampField limits (DEVDESK-790)
63ad0835 fix(palette): re-seat without SetValue so suggestions survive bubbles v2.2.2 (DEVDESK-788)
b17f3960 fix(fields): clamp one-line fields to their box despite VS16 emoji (DEVDESK-790)
ac31cf81 test(components): red tests for ClampField and VS16 fields (DEVDESK-790)
f50279e6 fix(filterbar): give the search field a width and let it scroll (DEVDESK-789)
833e078a test(components): red tests for FilterBar field width and scroll (DEVDESK-789)
61cc88c6 fix(palette): re-seat the command field only when its width changes (DEVDESK-788)
30b9c8ae fix(palette): re-seat the command field after a shrink (DEVDESK-788)
8cd49c94 test(components): red tests for ReseatInput and the palette field after a resize (DEVDESK-788)
package components

import "charm.land/bubbles/v2/textinput"

// ReseatInput rebuilds the scroll window of a textinput for its current width,
// keeping its value, cursor position, Err and suggestions.
//
// bubbles scrolls a textinput through two internal offsets (offset and
// offsetRight) that only SetCursor, SetValue and Update refresh. After a
// SetWidth that shrinks the field, a cursor still inside the old window leaves
// that too wide window in place: the view overflows its box and the cursor cell
// can land beyond it (bubbles v2.2.1 and v2.2.2). Call it after every SetWidth
// that can shrink a field, from Update only (Rule 110), never from View.
//
